  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Termination of contracts",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [
        "Termination of contracts"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Procure > Finalise and publish procurement pack",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Termination of contracts"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Termination of contracts",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This regulation places an obligation on contracting authorities to ensure that every public contract incorporates certain termination rights. This includes situations where the contract has been subject to a substantial modification which would have required a new procurement procedure in accordance with regulation 72 PCR 2015 (modification of contracts during their term), or where, at the time of contract award, the supplier should have been excluded from the procurement for meeting one or more grounds for exclusion.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Termination of contracts",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The regulation also provides that the contract provisions may set out the basis on which the mandatory termination rights shall operate e.g. by providing a notice of termination and by addressing consequential matters that will or might arise from the termination.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Termination of contracts",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "To the extent that a public contract does not include the termination rights required under this regulation (i.e. regulation 73), these rights must be treated as implied terms of the contract and may be exercisable on the contracting authority giving reasonable notice to the supplier.",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Termination of contracts",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Termination of contracts",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The contract should include explicit provisions that enable the contracting authority to terminate the contract in the situations stipulated under this regulation (i.e. regulation 73(1)).",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Termination of contracts",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Termination of contracts",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities should:",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Termination of contracts",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure that the contract includes provisions that enable the contracting authority to terminate the contract in the situations stipulated under this regulation (i.e. regulation 73(1))",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Termination of contracts",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure that the termination provisions clearly explain the process for termination and how any consequential matters arising from the termination will be dealt with.",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Termination of contracts",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "heading",
